# NIDP Cloud Build upload filter.
#
# The Dockerfile only COPYs `backend/nidp/` into the image, so
# everything else in the repo is dead weight on the upload tarball.
# Default gcloudignore (which mirrors .gitignore) was uploading
# ~50 MiB and timing out from slow links. This file pushes the
# tarball under ~5 MiB.

# Exclude everything by default, then re-include the NIDP tree.
*

# Re-include only what Dockerfile needs.
!backend/
backend/*
!backend/nidp/
!backend/nidp/**

# Drop noisy NIDP internals that don't need to ship.
backend/nidp/**/__pycache__/
backend/nidp/**/*.pyc
backend/nidp/data/
backend/nidp/.gh-token
backend/nidp/local-out/

# Standard hygiene.
.git/
.github/
*.log
.DS_Store
